#38303
emp emperor~
the Emperor~
The Emperor of Llyndyr is here, cold-eyed and watchful.
~
The Emperor of Llyndyr is a tall, hard-faced man with iron-gray hair and
eyes as cold as a winter sea.  He wears a cape of black silk and a
necklace set with a single great emerald, and the hilt of a black sword
rises above his shoulder.  Old scars cross his hands and his face: he
did not win his empire from behind a desk.
~
